#, c-format
msgid "Sets the bad words kicker on or off. When enabled, this option tells the bot to kick users who say certain words on the channels.\n\nYou can define bad words for your channel using the BADWORDS command. Type %sBADWORDS for more information.\n\nttb is the number of times a user can be kicked before it gets banned. Don't give ttb to disable the ban system once activated."
